  <item>
    <title>帅 是一种感觉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695b7ab49b7892496eb4b9e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695b7ab49b7892496eb4b9e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Jan 2026 08:56:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新年快乐Mr.BB的听众友友们,感谢你们2025一整年对鲍鲍的支持和爱。本次是2026年的第一档播客节目,我们有幸邀请到了来自NOUS的说唱歌手SIMBA辛巴以及他的好朋友One Eric,两位好朋友助阵。时代飞逝,我们对帅也逐渐有了自己的认知,从视觉上直观的帅，再到由内向外的细节的帅。到底什么才是真正的帅? emmm…本次节目让我们和鲍鲍/SIMBA辛巴/Oen Eric一起走进帅的新视界,gogogo! !</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpb5cG6XoxohU57MVs-xc3rcP1og.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>帅是一种感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期收听内容:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>:个人认为哪些才是真正帅的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a>:昊哥的校园都市传说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a>: eric的贴吧抽象故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a>:辛巴说唱路上遇到硬凹帅的同行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a>:街头足球遇上巴西战舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a>:深度迷恋范丞示/王嘉尔and校园生存智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2158">35:58</a>:辛巴不太敢回看自己的综艺表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2750">45:50</a>:几位如何看待自己年龄上升后的状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3145">52:25</a>:幻想自己人生最期待的画面和瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目制作:TimeSir (小虎)</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1:《Underground Nation地下国度》nous underground2025cypher/SIMBA辛巴</span></p><span></span><p><span>2:《枯木逢春》SIMBA辛巴/梁老师Tsong/AFMC黑子</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：（添加@鲍小秀）：BBSHOW2025（微信）</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作发送至邮箱：1277303721@qq.com（请注明来意）</span></p>]]></description>
