  <item>
    <title>EP06脏饼干的来时路是铁路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69202baa6018cc2c98eeacca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69202baa6018cc2c98eeacca</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Nov 2025 09:10:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：@鲍鲍show &nbsp;@脏饼干</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期邀请节目到的嘉宾是来自陕西周至的本土Rapper出自厂牌BeefGang，也是鲍鲍show第一次邀请rapper来做电台。这期节目用轻松愉快的方式了解一下rapper脏饼干的原生家庭，从陕西出生到河南生活及上学时期遇到的事情。从只能感受到街头的冰冷到目前能感受到余温温暖的内心转化。很开心能邀请到饼干讲述自己的一路历程。伴随并庆祝饼干近期发布了他个人首张专辑《Street Cold Heart》。让我们一起跟鲍鲍沉浸式感受脏饼干的hiphop来时路go！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWfCYHtQvxyKF7CcwAIuaKf27_I.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期收听内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="198">03:18</a>：谢帝的帮助</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a>：离开陕西去郑州的铁路童年&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a>：原生家庭跟爷爷奶奶长大的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a>：极端教育下开智的转变开始接触hiphop文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a>：专辑后的规划</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目制作人：TimeSir（小虎）</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：收录于脏饼干《Street cold heart》专辑</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.《彼福》feat谢帝</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.《虫儿飞》feat贰万</span></p><span></span><p><span>3.《牛牛娃》featNaseem丸子</span></p><span></span><p><span>4.《HER》脏饼干&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>5.脏饼干个人单曲《拍拍灰》</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：（添加@鲍小秀）：BBSHOW2025（微信）</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作发送至邮箱：1277303721@qq.com（请注明来意）</span></p>]]></description>
