  <item>
    <title>EP05:我小时候一玩在城墙上玩三天，家长是什么我不知道啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6821853524f8559346245ede</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6821853524f8559346245ede</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 May 2025 08:59:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目抽象浓度超标,没有提纲、没有逻辑、甚至有时候没有完整句子的播客，全程靠嘉宾的随性输出。从撒大米防僵尸被亲妈制裁，到拍短剧请投资我们，用行动证明——人生不需要意义，我这么多年就是这样混过来的。从英语课本的草莓奶昔、网吧追剧的青春、和《哈利波特》的魔幻记忆……主打一个怀旧，但彻底歪楼。温馨提示：收听时请勿进食喝水，以免笑喷呛住（本节目无任何售后服务）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鲍鲍（陕北美式男孩）</span></p><span></span><p><span>@落难王子（豹子）</span></p><span></span><p><span>@都是爱情陷阱（佳豪！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmYELSjq3zA1IvPw60AajKC6yu7g.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期你将会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">06:23</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>影视剧讨论:B站解说比原片香，弹幕才是灵魂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">07:02</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>国产剧回忆：《平凡的世界》方言尴尬现场，嘉宾幻想合拍土味短剧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>脑洞剧本：妹妹被霸凌，三个哥哥（霸总、流浪汉、窝囊废）轮番救场。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>经典老剧：《风云雄霸天下》台词复刻，“成也风云，败也风云”引发全员中二魂。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>影视剧美食：《神医喜来乐》红烧狮子头、《周星驰电影》黯然销魂饭，隔着屏幕流口水！</span></p><span></span><p><span>英语课本“草莓奶昔”成童年未解之谜：“李雷和韩梅梅到底过的是什么神仙日子？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">40:04</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>奇葩经历：豹子自曝被骗入传销组织，靠“装睡+袜藏银行卡”成功逃脱！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>迷惑操作：撒大米防僵尸，被亲妈当场制裁。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">01:05:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">01:06:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>KFC启蒙：“老爷爷头像”成童年奢侈品象征。</span></p><span></span><p><span>迷惑行为：卖电饭锅、煤气罐换零花钱，家庭GDP贡献者实锤！</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>Croatian Rhapsody（克罗地亚狂想曲）——Maksim Mrvica</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群（添加@鲍小秀）：BBSHOW2025（微信）</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：BBSHOW2025@163.com（请注明来意）</span></p>]]></description>
