  <item>
    <title>EP03.我的五一记忆：为寻找藏獒被亲妈扇巴掌，为寻找ipad跨省抓小偷</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680e09ea7a449ae858fd493e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680e09ea7a449ae858fd493e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Apr 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五一假期临近，本期节目围绕“旅行”展开，既有脱口秀演员的爆笑假期日常，也有童年旅行糗事、猎奇冒险故事，以及每个人心中对“完美旅行”的终极幻想。从绿皮火车的社死回忆到泰国泼水节的惊险体验，从抓小偷的硬核追债到意大利的阳光幻想——旅行不仅是风景，更是人与世界的奇妙碰撞。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>@鲍鲍（陕北美式男孩）脱口秀演员、hiphop爱好者、少年时夏令营受害者</span></p><span></span><p><span>@苏云尚 脱口秀演员、《下下签》制作人、喜剧才子、讲长段子的王</span></p><span></span><p><span>@奥夫山姆 雁楠 社会活动家、出差路上的旅行家</span></p><span></span><p><span>@梦媛在这儿呢 节目制作人、在等待一次浪漫旅行的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>现场照片:</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnrbcKfDPhRWyq-jraoGaKTx4VdQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>鲍鲍寻獒之旅MVP结算画面展示：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkH89o_F6xp6uO2wgooarP9hiN8a.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvUdSvJMDNnjQhATyqFeB3v3nhyE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期节目你可能听到：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a></span></strong><span> 吴鼎出场费大公开</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="718">11:58</a></span></strong><span>雁楠的泰国“大哥团”见闻</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a></span></strong><span>鲍鲍童年旅行糗事大公开（绿皮火车噩梦、给自己上“满清十大酷刑”、藏獒情未了）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a></span></strong><span>苏云尚的长沙追债记，现实版《守护解放西》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2666">44:26</a></span></strong><span>鲍爸的“香格里拉迷惑之旅”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3189">53:09</a></span></strong><span>梦媛还想去一次的无人区之旅</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3354">55:54</a></span></strong><span>鲍鲍梦想中的完美之旅：公海游轮躺平，甲板晒太阳+深夜开放麦惊艳全场(脱口秀版《海上钢琴师》)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3673">01:01:13</a></span></strong><span>梦媛的完美旅行</span><strong><span>：</span></strong><span>意大利佛罗伦萨晒太阳，毫无目的享受阳光。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4344">01:12:24</a></span></strong><span>苏云尚：说走就走的公路旅行，和兄弟凌晨2点跨省call人集合。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区分享#你心中的完美旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sun Don't Leave Me——Raveena</span></p><span></span><p><span>像风一样自由——许巍</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群（添加@鲍小秀）：BBSHOW2025（微信）</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：BBSHOW2025@163.com（请注明来意）</span></p>]]></description>
